Competition Rules Description
1. The Super Cup is a competition in which players use three cars in sequence to complete the race on the same track, and are finally ranked based on the total time;
2. The Super Cup event consists of 4 stages: preparation-registration-match-settlement; 
3. During the preparation period, contestants need to assemble three racing cars and can conduct unlimited test runs. Please ensure that the combination is reasonable and then click the entry button on the left to lock the four-wheel drive parking space;
4. During the registration period, players need to click the registration button to register. Please note: If you do not register successfully, you will not be able to participate in subsequent competitions;
5. During the competition, players who have successfully registered will be able to participate. The order of participation is from left to right according to the position of the participating vehicles on the left. Players can compete unlimited times;
6. The competition results will be based on the best total score and ranking;
7. The end of the game is the settlement time. During the settlement period, you will not be able to participate in this game. Please plan your challenge time;
8. Rewards will be distributed by email after the event.

Description of competition rules:
1. The overall duration of the club event is 2 days, starting every Saturday and Sunday (the time will be adjusted according to the expansion of gameplay);
2. During the duration of the event, players can choose their own three cars to match the selected There are three maps. If there is an unmatched map, it will be regarded as giving up the challenge for this map.
3. Click the car on the left to select the car that needs to be entered into battle. Click on the map to match the car with the map; if you want to cancel the current If a car enters the battle, click on the selected car to cancel;
4. If you withdraw from the game midway during the challenge, it will be directly deemed as a challenge failure;
5. Players have a maximum number of challenges per day, and each track The points earned are different depending on the completion time of the challenge. The points are the total points obtained from the three tracks. Rewards can be claimed when the points reach a certain level;
6. After the event, the personal challenge and club challenge scores will be reset, and the rewards will not be claimed at that time. Expired items will not be reissued. Please pay attention to the time and collect club and individual rewards;
7. All individual rewards and club rewards can only be claimed once per player per season;
8. When the club event starts, players If you choose to withdraw from the membership or be kicked out by the president, your personal challenge points and points accumulated in the current club will still be retained. After joining a new club, the points accumulated by you before will not be added to the new club;

1. The Lucky Wheel is a Limited-Time event;
2. During the event, you can use lottery props for drawing, and multiple lottery props can be drawn continuously, up to 10 times;
3. Check the box to skip the wheel rotation animation and draw quickly; 
4. Lottery props can be obtained through event gift packs or holiday activities; 
5. Lottery props are holiday props and cannot be used after the carousel is over. The lottery props used in each event are different, so please use them as soon as possible during the event;
6. The orange accessories of this turntable will be decomposed to obtain the corresponding number of [Four-wheel drive gems];

1.The character collecting game is a time-limited activity in which players have a chance to obtain one random character card by completing relevant daily activities.
2.The daily activities that can yield character cards are:
2.1. Probability drop in plot PVE levels;
2.2. Probability drop after completing a ranked match;
2.3. Guaranteed drop in daily task active treasure chests;
2.4. Probability drop when giving friendship points.
3.The event lasts for 7 days, and the collected character cards can be used to exchange for rewards.
4.After the event ends, the character cards will become invalid. Participants should pay attention to the time and redeem rewards promptly.

1. The Peak Competition is divided into the audition stage, the Peak Competition stage, the B-level stage, and the settlement stage. Please pay attention to the competition time;
2. After the Peak Competition starts, the players will directly enter the event interface to select the vehicle. During the audition period, the players You can freely switch your own car to compete;
3. After selecting the vehicle, click Start Challenge to enter. You can run up to 3 times a day, and only the best results are recorded;
4. During the audition period, players can conduct unlimited trials Run and adjust your four-wheel drive through the test run results;
5. After the audition stage, the top 32 players will enter the peak competition stage, and other players will enter the B-level stage;
6. Players who enter the top 32 can compete every day There is an unlimited number of trial runs and 3 competition opportunities, and the player’s competition time is recorded. The shortest time of the three competition times is recorded;
7. The settlement time is between 23:40~0:40 on the last day of the audition and after the top 32, please Players, please pay attention to the time;
8. During the settlement time, players are not allowed to challenge;
9. Those who have been eliminated will be ranked from fastest to slow according to the last failed result, and the final ranking will be determined;
10 .After the players advance to the peak competition, they will not be allowed to participate in the B-level competition again; 
11. All players who have not advanced will compete in the B-level competition, and the rankings will start counting from the 33rd place; 
12. Those who enter the B-level competition Players can have unlimited trial runs and three competition opportunities every day. The matching rules are free matching. All competition times except failures (failure determinations such as rollover, crash, lapping, etc.) are recorded. The shortest time of the three competition times is recorded; 
13. During the top 32 competition, you can like the top 32 players to guess the champion. The person who guesses the champion correctly will receive a reward. After the top 32 is over, you cannot like it; 
14. If the player abandons the competition during the peak competition, you will not be able to like it. If you receive any reward, please pay attention to the competition time and participate in the competition in time;
Peak competition reward classification
1st, 2nd, 3rd-4th, 5th-8th, 9th-16th, 17th - 32 people, the rewards for each ranking range are the same, corresponding to 32 to 16, 16 to 8, 8 to 4, 4 to 2, and the finals

1. There are three stages in the club points competition, which are the pre-match preparation stage, the official competition stage, and the settlement stage;
2. The pre-match preparation stage requires the president or administrator to manually click to register to participate. Once you click to register, it will be counted as registration. Success, the players will know the opposing club after the official start of the game;
3. Clubs that register for the points competition cannot review applications, modify club information, modify positions, remove members, voluntarily withdraw from the club, or transfer the club president before the end of the season; 
4. The official competition period lasts for three days, and all points are finally calculated and ranked:
5. Contestants can challenge once a day. Failure will be counted as the number of challenges. Successful challenges will earn 20 points, and failure will result in no points
6. The track will be changed every day during the competition. The daily ranking will be settled based on speed, and the total ranking will be settled based on total points. The ranking of the day will be settled at 23:30 every day and the points obtained will be added to the club's total points. The top 16 in the ranking will be Players will receive additional points. The club results viewing interface will be refreshed every half hour, and the daily rankings will be refreshed every half hour. Please note that all participating players;
7. After the game, it will be based on the total points obtained by both clubs. By comparison, the party with higher points wins, and the party with lower points loses. If both clubs have the same points, it will be a draw;
8. All members of the winning club will receive the winning reward, and all members of the losing club will also receive a consolation prize. , a tie will result in a tie reward;
9. If the club has a bye, the game will be played normally, and as long as someone participates, it will be counted as a victory in this points competition
Instructions on reward distribution
Personal daily ranking reward distribution rules:\ nThe total club points on the first day must reach: 2,000 points (including daily personal point ranking bonus) before rewards can be issued
The total club points on the second day must reach: 4,000 points (including daily personal point ranking bonus) before rewards can be issued Rewards
The total club points on the third day must reach: 6,000 points (including the daily personal points ranking bonus) to issue rewards
Personal total points ranking reward distribution rules:
The total club points must reach 6,000 points in the points competition ( Including daily personal points ranking bonus) rewards can be issued
Rewards distribution rules for all club members' wins and losses:
The club's total points must reach 8100 points (including daily personal points ranking bonus) before rewards can be issued
If the club If the total points are not reached, you will not be able to obtain ranking rewards

Up to 50 clubs will be displayed in the club points competition rankings (Tied with the same points)

1. After returning to the game, the assistance shell activity will be opened, and only the players who return to the competition can participate in the assistance shell activity;
2. The rental Body Shell slot is unlocked according to the activity time, which can be directly unlocked by purchasing a weekly card or purchasing an advanced return check-in, and the slot will be permanently opened during the activity time after Purchase;
3. After the contestant chooses the desired Body Shell, he can use the Body Shell in any challenge without limiting the number of times he can use it;
4. After the player selects the assisted Body Shell, the Body Shell usage time is calculated according to the slot refresh time, the slot is refreshed every 14 days, and after 14 days, the previously selected Body Shell will automatically expire;
5. After the activity expires, the time-limited accessories that have not expired will still take effect until they expire within 14 days;
6. Each shell in the refresh time, the player can only choose one, can not be selected repeatedly, the selected shell is put into the backpack by default

1. The Brawl Championship is a full service game, participants should register within the specified time, when registering, they need to upload their mini 4WD vehicles, and the registration will be successful after successful uploading;
2. The cycle of Brawl Championship's audition mode is 21 days, one race per day, the race is divided into four phases: matching opponents, uploading vehicles, choosing the track, automatic race and settlement; 
 2.1 Matching Competitors Stage: During this stage, random matching of competitors will be conducted automatically for the participants; 
 2.2 Vehicle Uploading Stage: During this stage, mini 4WD vehicles can be deployed and uploaded; vehicle data can be uploaded multiple times, and the last uploaded data will be locked by default at the end of this stage; 
 2.3 Runway Selection Stage: Mini 4WD vehicles cannot be deployed during this stage, it is necessary to use the 3 uploaded 4WD vehicles to select the order of the runway, if not, the default is to match the runway according to the order of the uploaded vehicle stage;
 2.4 Auto Race and Settlement Stage: During this stage, the race will be conducted automatically, if both participants have flipped/flying cars in the same race, the participant with the last flipped/flying car will win by default; after the auto race is over, the points earned by the participants will be counted according to the result of the race (single win +3 points/single loss +0 points) and displayed in the leaderboard together with the race replay;
3. At the end of the Brawl Championship Audition Mode, the Top 64 contestants will be decided based on the points ranking; whether or not the Top 64 contestants are decided, additional matches will be opened (1 day);
 3.1 When a participant who has not entered the Top 64 has the same number of points as the 64th ranked participant, all participants with the same number of points as the 64th ranked participant will enter the Extra Match;
 3.2 Additional Race Rule 1: The additional race will be on the same map and participants can only use one 4WD vehicle to race; the race will be an automatic race, and the race format will be a single-vehicle, single-map mode;
 3.3 Additional Rule 2: The additional race will determine the participants to enter the Top 64 through the race results (time);
4. Top 64 Elimination Rule: 
 4.1 The Top 64 Knockout Stage will be automatically grouped and one race will be held each day until the first runner-up and second runner-up are decided; 
 4.2 Disable Track Stage: 10 race tracks will be shown to the participants in this stage, each participant can disable 2 tracks within the specified time (both participants can disable the same track), the disabled tracks will not appear in the Top 64 Elimination Race; 
 4.3 Vehicle Uploading Stage: During this stage, you can deploy the Mini 4WD vehicles and upload the data of 1 Mini 4WD vehicle; you can upload the vehicle data several times; at the end of the time of this stage, if you have not uploaded the vehicle, the last uploaded data of the previous stage will be locked by default;
 4.4 Runway Selection Stage: this stage cannot deploy mini 4WD vehicles, it is necessary to use the uploaded 1 vehicle for runway selection; if not, the default is to match the runway according to the order of the uploaded vehicle stage; 
 4.5 Automatic Race Stage: During this stage, the race will be conducted automatically, and the winner will be determined by the speed of time; if both participants have flipped/flew over in the same race, the participant who flipped/flew over at the end will be the winner by default; 
 4.6 Settlement Stage: During this stage, the results of automatic races will be displayed in the participant's group advancement details together with the race replay; 
 4.7 Guessing Mechanism: After the grouping of the Top 64 elimination matches is completed and before the matches start, all participants can participate in the guessing; the Top 64 and Top 32 elimination matches will use Gold to guess, and the Top 16 and above matches will use Diamond to guess; 
5. After the champion and runner-up are decided, the event will be settled and rewards will be sent to each participant by mail;

Spare parts rental instructions:n1. Players can initiate a rental request to all the accessories owned by their friends, and after the other party agrees, they can use the rented accessories to compete; 
2. Players can rent all orange accessories owned by friends, and the list of accessories is determined according to the configuration; 
3. The rented accessories will enter the Limited-Time props in the backpack, and the accessories will be deleted after the countdown ends; 
4. The level, algebra, transformation entry attributes, skill level, and color style of the rented accessories are consistent with the accessories of friends; 
5. During the rental period of the accessory, friends can still use this accessory to compete; 
6. The same accessory of the player can only be lent to one friend, and the other party can use it for up to one week, and the rented accessory will be returned after 7 days; 
7. Players can only rent orange quality accessories from friends, and only one rented accessory can be used to win a battle once a week in the story, special training, new training, and confrontation match; Only one rental accessory can be used per challenge; 
8. Renting accessories does not affect the sweeping behavior of the plot and special training; 
9. Up to 3 accessories can be rented at the same time per week, and up to 5 rental requests can be sent at the same time; 
10. You cannot rent accessories from friends who have not been online for more than 7 days

Spare parts employment instructions:
1. Players can initiate employment requests to friends or members who have corresponding accessories in the same club, and after the friends agree, they can use the hired accessories to compete; 
2. The hired accessories are unified as ordinary orange quality level 1 accessories, and players need to cultivate this accessory by themselves; After the lease expires, the already hired accessories will not disappear and the growth will be retained, but they cannot be used for any gameplay (i.e. locked state), and the right to use can be unlocked by hiring again;
3. Players can hire all accessories in the accessories list, and the accessories list is decided according to the configuration; 
4. The same accessory can be lent to up to 5 friend members for 30 days per hire; 
5. Hired accessories will be placed in the Limited-Time items in the backpack, and new accessories will not be hired after the quantity limit is exceeded
6. Players need to consume 4WD coins each time they hire accessories (the specific number goes to the configuration); After hiring the accessory of the same name 6 times in a special currency, the 7th time will no longer consume 4WD coinsn7. For accessories of the same name, players can send up to 5 employment requirements at the same timen8. The employment of accessories is regarded as the player's own accessories, and there is no restriction on playing during the employment period; n9. Do not hire accessories that have not been online for more than 7 daysn

Race Rules Description
1. In this event, players must race three cars sequentially on different tracks, and the final ranking is based on the total time;
2. The event consists of 4 stages: Preparation, Registration, Race, and Settlement;
3. During the Preparation stage, players need to assemble three cars and can conduct unlimited test runs. Please ensure a reasonable setup, then click the "Join" button on the left to lock the car slots;
4. During the Registration stage, players must click the "Register" button to sign up. Please note: Failure to register successfully will result in disqualification from the upcoming races;
5. During the Race stage, only successfully registered players can participate. The cars will challenge the tracks sequentially from left to right, and players can race an unlimited number of times;
6. Each player's best total race time will be used for the final ranking;
7. After the Race stage, the event enters the Settlement stage. Players cannot participate in races during this period, so please plan your challenge time accordingly;
8. Rewards will be distributed via in-game mail after the event ends.

1. The Super Peak Tournament is a cross-server regional gameplay, and the specific region column can be viewed in the announcement, and the opening time of the event has been announced, and the competition is divided into the audition stage, the Super Peak stage, the B-level stage, and the settlement stage, please pay attention to the game time; 
2.After the Super PeakRace starts, players can directly enter the event interface to select a vehicle, and players can freely switch their own cars to compete during the audition; 
3.After selecting the car, click Start Challenge to enter, you can run up to 5 times a day, and only record the best time; 
4.During the audition, players can run an unlimited number of test runs to adjust their 4WD through the test run results; 
5.After the audition stage, the top 32 players will enter the Super Peakstage, and the other players will enter the B stage; 
6.Runners who enter the top 32 can have an unlimited number of test runs and 3 race opportunities every day, and record the player's competition time, and the shortest time of five competitions will be recorded; 
7.The settlement time is 23:40~0:40 on the last day of the audition and after the top 32, please pay attention to the time; 
8.Players are not allowed to challenge during the settlement time; 
9.Those who have been eliminated will be ranked according to the results of the last defeat from fastest to slowest, and the final ranking will be determined; 
10.Players will not be allowed to participate in the B Division after they have advanced to the ซุปเปอร์พีค; 
11.All players who do not advance will face off in the B Division, and the leaderboard will be counted from 33rd place; 
12.Competitors entering the B Division can have an unlimited number of test runs and 5 race opportunities per day, and the matching rules are free matching, and all race times except for failures (failure judgments such as rollovers, crashes, rings, etc.) will be recorded, and the shortest time will be recorded for five races; 
13.During the top 32 of the Super PeakCompetition, you can like and guess the champion for the top 32 players, and those who guess the champion correctly will be rewarded, and they will not be able to like after the top 32 ends; 
14.If a player abandons the race during the Super PeakTournament, he or she will not be able to get any rewards, please pay attention to the competition time and participate in the competition in time; 
Super PeakTournament reward grading
1st, 2nd, 3rd-4th, 5th-8th, 9th-16th, 17th-32nd, the rewards for each bracket ranking range are the same, corresponding to 32 to 16, 16 to 8, 8 to 4, 4 to 2, and the finals

European Cup Guessing Game Instructions:
Players can purchase guessing coins through the mall, which can be used to exchange item or predict on matches in the mall; the guessing results in the game are consistent with the results of the European Cup; the results of the European Cup will be synchronized to the game after the match, and players can receive corresponding guessing rewards after synchronization;
Guessing Coins: can be purchased in the mall, and can be used to exchange item or predict on matches in the mall;
Guessing Time: players can predict before the current match starts, and predicts use guessing coins, which cannot be changed after guessing, so please choose carefully;
Reward Multiplier: The displayed reward multiples will not change, and the undisplayed reward multiples will be updated according to the schedule. Players need to pay attention to the changes in the reward multiples of the subsequent schedules in the game; 
Guessing Rewards: If the guessing result currently selected by the player is consistent with the match result, the guessing reward will be received according to the reward multiplier; if the guessing results are inconsistent, according to the rule of 1 guessing coin = 200 gold coins, the corresponding number of gold coins will be received when claiming the guessing; 
Receiving rewards: The match results are not synchronized in real time. Please wait for the match results to be updated to the game, and then receive the corresponding rewards in the event interface;

America's Cup Guessing Game Instructions:
Players can purchase guessing coins through the mall, which can be used to redeem item or guess matches in the mall; the guessing results in the game are consistent with the results of the America's Cup; the results of the America's Cup will be synchronized to the game after the match, and players can receive corresponding guessing rewards after synchronization;
Guessing Coins: can be purchased in the mall, and can be used to redeem item or guess matches in the mall;
Guessing Time: players can guess before the current match starts, and guessing uses guessing coins. Guessing cannot be changed after guessing, so please choose carefully;
Reward Multiplier: The displayed reward multiples will not change, and the undisplayed reward multiples will be updated according to the schedule. Players need to pay attention to the changes in the reward multiples of the subsequent schedules in the game; 
Guessing Rewards: If the guessing result currently selected by the player is consistent with the match result, the guessing reward will be received according to the reward multiplier; if the guessing results are inconsistent, according to the rule of 1 guessing coin = 200 gold coins, the corresponding number of gold coins will be received when claiming the guessing; 
Receiving rewards: The match results are not synchronized in real time. Please wait for the match results to be updated to the game, and then collect the corresponding rewards in the event interface;
